<title>USA: TABLE - Genlyte Group Inc Q2 shr rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Genlyte Group Inc Q2 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>UNION, N.J. 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>For the three months ended</p>
<p>				  Jun 28, 1997	     Jun 29, 1996</p>
<p> Net Sales			$  120,700		  $ 112,440</p>
<p> EBIT				    9,386			6,373</p>
<p> Income before Taxes		 8,222			4,829</p>
<p> Net Income			    4,689			2,751</p>
<p> E.P.S.				   0.35			 0.21</p>
<p>Average Shares</p>
<p>	Outstanding		   13,374		     13,002</p>
<p>						For the six months ended</p>
<p>				  Jun 28, 1997	     Jun 29, 1996</p>
<p> Net Sales			$  233,998		  $ 221,102</p>
<p> EBIT				   16,489		     11,949</p>
<p> Income before Taxes		14,354			8,853</p>
<p> Net Income			    8,182			5,045</p>
<p> E.P.S.				   0.61			 0.39</p>
<p> Average Shares Outstanding     13,357		     12,959</p>
<p>	     (Amounts in thousands except per share data)</p>
<p>NOTE: Company attributed sales growth to strong commercial construction market and emphasis on new products.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
